  m_Name: beatrice
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: beatrice
  title: "\u7B2C\u4E8C\u5E55 \xB7 \u8D1D\u963F\u7279\u4E3D\u5207\u7684\u4FBF\u6761"
  context: "2026-11-02 返回改稿；见 doc/performance-edit。"
  testOnly: 0
  initialVisitor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3fa28df6608b7f44db2e8d65e4be1b05, type: 2}
  arrivalSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a90926b1834a5135a7889bc8801033ca, type: 3}
  closeShutterOnComplete: 1
  arrivalDelay: 0.54485416
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99e1ffdb51533854ea9cf197f5a21f35, type: 2}
    text: "威尼斯代表贝阿特丽切找你，她带了一份文件来。"
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3fa28df6608b7f44db2e8d65e4be1b05, type: 2}
    text: "你就是卢卡大师吧？我调查这个事情已经几天了，你的一个行会同事给了我一张字条。"
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3fa28df6608b7f44db2e8d65e4be1b05, type: 2}
    text: "他不想当证人牵扯进来，写的密码。你应该能够破解它。"
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3fa28df6608b7f44db2e8d65e4be1b05, type: 2}
    text: "我差不多知道里面会写什么，但是我的立场让我不能跟进这个线索了。"
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f79a256ca015acd40a1a1621c22a6779, type: 2}
    text: "那把便条给我吧，我会自己确认的。"
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99e1ffdb51533854ea9cf197f5a21f35, type: 2}
    text: "威尼斯代表带来的资料登记好了，我给你送进去。"
